     1	## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners
     2	
     3	Committee ruling (binding for extract):
     4	
     5	Committee minutes show owner churn from unsigned drafts. Ledger owner is the
     6	default. Meeting note amendments under `#### Amendment for TXN-<uuid>` replace
     7	owner when `signed: true` (case insensitive) and, when the amendment includes
     8	`effective: YYYY-MM-DD`, only if that date is greater than or equal to the
     9	ledger date for the transaction.
