     2	
     3	Committee ruling (binding for extract):
     4	
     5	Finance QA traced rerun drift to parsers that latched onto the wrong ledger
     6	slice. For extractor output, treat only the markdown section whose heading
     7	line is exactly `## Transaction Ledger` as authoritative. The archive also
     8	contains a working-copy ledger and prose that mentions ledger headings; those
     9	are investigative context only.
    10	
    11	Ignore any ledger block that includes a line `provisional: true` (case
    12	insensitive). When the same transaction id appears in multiple non-provisional
    13	ledger blocks, the last such block in file order is the base row for that id.
    14	
