     1	## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)
     2	
     3	Extract policy (authoritative):
     4	
     5	Exception coding review: `exception_reason` is null unless a code applies. Set
     6	`over_limit` when `amount_usd` strictly exceeds 10000. Set `compliance_hold`
     7	when final status is `rejected`, a qualifying `compliance@` email referenced
     8	that transaction, and that email block includes a `sent:` line. The sent-date
     9	comparison used for `compliance_hold` is defined in Investigation Brief 09
    10	(Mid-Year Amendment), not Brief 03. Multiple reasons join with semicolon in
    11	lexical order of the reason codes.
